| ADR-014 | Accepted | Select **libssh2** as the primary SSH engine (2026-07-28 owner decision). `ReluxNIOSSH` is retained as recorded comparative evidence and receives no further fork work unless new evidence invalidates libssh2. Selection rests on the ADR-023 M0-viability gate set plus macOS-harness conformance evidence; per-channel window, scale, and memory numbers remain M3 physical-evidence gates and are not asserted by this decision. |
