+Evidence logs are `.temp/TASK-260715-1pn983/{tool-readiness-01,contract-validation-01,contract-validation-02,diagram-validation-01,board-validation-01,checklist-validation-01,resource-byte-match-01}.log`.
+
+No build or runtime test was run because this is a documentation/architecture
+delta with no production code change. Validation is scoped to formulas,
