+
+## Validation
+
+| Gate | Exit | Result |
+| --- | ---: | --- |
+| Input SHA-256 verification | 0 | Both supplied digests match exactly |
+| PlantUML syntax and SVG render | 0 | Two sources valid; two SVGs rendered and visually inspected |
